@startuml
title 数字对象核心设计类图
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45

enum ObjectStatus {
  ACTIVE
  DELETED
  UNKNOWN
}

class DigitalObject {
  -identifier: String
  -status: ObjectStatus
  -revision: long
  --
  +validateInvariants()
  +copy()
}

class IdentifierCode <<标识>> {
  -regionCode: String
  -organizationCode: String
  -industryCode: String
  -dataCategoryCode: String
  -registrationTypeCode: String
  -date: String
  -credential: String
  --
  +compact()
}

class IdentifierMetadata <<元数据>> {
  -identifier: String
  -owner: String
  -name: String
  -description: String
  -applicationScenario: String
  -entityType: String
  -additionalAttributes: Map<String,Object>
  --
  +validateForUpdate()
  +copy()
}

class Resource <<资源>> {
  -componentType: String
  -storageType: String
  -accessMethod: String
  -contentType: String
  -format: String
  -locator: String
  -size: long
  -hashValue: String
  --
  +validate()
  +copy()
}

class ResourceVersion <<资源版本>> {
  -versionNo: long
  -providerVersionId: String
  -sourceUploadId: String
  -verifyStatus: String
  -createdAt: String
  --
  +copy()
}

DigitalObject -[hidden]down- IdentifierCode
IdentifierCode -[hidden]right- IdentifierMetadata
IdentifierMetadata -[hidden]right- Resource

DigitalObject *-- "1" IdentifierCode : 标识
DigitalObject *-- "1" IdentifierMetadata : 元数据
DigitalObject *-- "0..1" Resource : 资源
DigitalObject --> ObjectStatus
ResourceVersion ..> Resource : 版本快照

note right of DigitalObject
  数字对象是系统核心聚合根，
  统一组织标识、元数据和资源信息
end note

note bottom of IdentifierCode
  表示对象的唯一标识编码
end note

note bottom of IdentifierMetadata
  描述对象的业务语义与属性
end note

note bottom of Resource
  描述对象关联的实际资源入口
end note
@enduml
